review.description:
Check the mappings and readings:

{summary}

[valid] means a readable numeric value and unit; it does not guarantee a physically correct sensor choice. [cumulative_energy]: replace the cumulative counter. [exceeds_capacity]: remaining energy is above capacity × 1.10. Other codes indicate unavailable/invalid data or an unexpected direction. Edit any step to correct mappings. For Home calculation, negative_balance indicates a negative balance: check boundary, signs and readings. Freshness is checked on the running sensor.

